# Design workspace environment (paths and identifiers only, never secrets). Copy to claude.env if you need it.
# AISDLC_ROOT is resolved from the current folder automatically; set it only to run from elsewhere.

# Claude Design design system to author against (optional). A name/identifier is not a secret.
# When set, /aisdlc-design:design reads it as a constraint alongside the local design-system/ files.
# AISDLC_DESIGN_SYSTEM=acme-portal
# AISDLC_DESIGN_SYSTEM_URL=https://claude.ai/design/...

# Default authoring source for new prototypes (optional): html | claude-design
# AISDLC_DESIGN_SOURCE=html
